{
  "key": "01-starter",
  "name": "Second Nature: Starter",
  "img": "systems/morphgame/assets/art/cover.jpg",
  "caption": "Everything for a first night: six ready-made Bonded, the Hunt, the rules, and five missions with their maps.",
  "description": "<p>Kids who can become animals, against the rich and secret Gilded Hunt. This adventure brings everything a first night needs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The six ready-made Bonded</strong> of Chapter 18, with their portraits, and <strong>the Hunt</strong>: Beaters, Hounds, Trappers, Huntsmen and the Masters.</li>\n<li><strong>A scene for Wrenfield and for each of the five missions</strong>, from the easy first night at Pemberton's Pets to the Lodge on the Hill. Every map marker has a pin that opens the mission's journal; the guards wait as hidden tokens beside their obstacle.</li>\n<li><strong>The rules</strong> and the one-page reference, as journals.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>To play:</strong> give each player a Bonded, open the scene for <em>Pemberton's Pets</em>, then open the Mission Tracker (the paw button in the token controls), tick the players' Bonded and press <strong>Start the mission</strong>.</p>",
